Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Reverts enable-full-gamma-range.reg — deletes the GdiIcmGammaRange value
; and restores Windows' default clamp on SetDeviceGammaRamp. After this,
; Starlight Filter's slider will again stop having a visible effect below
; roughly 3700 K (Gacrux).
;
; Requires a sign-out / sign-in (or reboot) to apply.
;
; The leading "-" before the value name is registry-file syntax for
; "delete this value" (the ICM key itself is left intact).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows NT\CurrentVersion\ICM]
"GdiIcmGammaRange"=-
